{% comment %}
  KRAFTMART — GROOM'S WEDDING HERITAGE SECTION
  Showcases traditional ceremonial groom talwars & customization
{% endcomment %}

<section class="km-section km-section-dark">
  <div class="km-container">
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 60px;">
      <div>
        <span class="km-eyebrow" style="color: var(--km-gold-light);">THE GROOM'S HERITAGE</span>
        <h2 class="km-heading-1" style="color: #FFF; margin-bottom: 20px;">Honor Tradition on Your Special Day</h2>
        <p class="km-body-lead" style="color: var(--km-text-muted-light); margin-bottom: 28px;">
          In Indian wedding culture, a groom carrying a ceremonial sword symbolizes protection, royal lineage, and honor. Our wedding talwars feature velvet-sheathed scabbards, hand-engraved brass hilts, and personalized blade inscriptions.
        </p>

        <div style="background-color: var(--km-bg-dark-card); border: var(--km-border-gold); padding: 24px; border-radius: var(--km-radius-md); margin-bottom: 32px;">
          <h4 style="font-family: var(--km-font-heading); font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--km-gold-light); margin-bottom: 8px;">✨ Free Custom Laser Engraving</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--km-text-muted-light);">
            Inscribe the Bride & Groom's names, wedding date, or family crest directly onto the blade at zero additional cost.
          </p>
        </div>

        <a href="/collections/all" class="km-btn km-btn-gold">
          Shop Wedding Talwars →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <img src="{{ 'sword.png' | asset_url }}" alt="KraftMart Groom Wedding Talwar" style="max-height: 480px; margin: 0 auto; filter: drop-shadow(0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5));" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Wedding Campaign",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Wedding Campaign",
      "category": "Banners"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
